{"claims":[
{"text":"The driver's own trace places him at a single, constant position 219.77 m from the pickup pin, held at 0.0 km/h for the entire 330-second window from 13:05:00 to 13:10:30 — outside the 120 m LARGE_VENUE arrival radius but inside the 400 m wrong-entrance ceiling. This is a POL-NS-03 wrong-point hold, not an abandonment: the driver held position for longer than the 300-second dwell the policy requires for LARGE_VENUE, so the case is governed by POL-NS-03's coordinate test and not by any non-attendance or bad-faith theory.","evidence_ids":["EV-GPS-09105","EV-TRIP-09105"],"clause_ids":["POL-NS-03"],"relies_on":"derived.driver_track","asserted_weight":1.0},
{"text":"The arrival marker at 13:05:20 is not a false arrival under POL-NS-05: at that moment the trace puts the driver 219.77 m from the pin, short of the 300 m trigger, and at 0.0 km/h, below the 15 km/h motion trigger set by POL-NS-05. No false-arrival finding and no POL-NS-05(ii) referral can attach to this driver.","evidence_ids":["EV-GPS-09105","EV-TRIP-09105"],"clause_ids":["POL-NS-05"],"relies_on":"derived.arrival.thresholds.motion_speed_kph","asserted_weight":1.0},
{"text":"The driver did not leave the rider's locating message unanswered: the rider's message was sent at 13:05:05 and the driver replied at 13:06:00, fifty-five seconds later and well inside the 120-second limit, so limb (b) of POL-NS-04 fails and the rider cannot be exonerated under that clause on the ground of driver silence.","evidence_ids":["EV-CHAT-09105","EV-TRIP-09105"],"clause_ids":["POL-NS-04"],"asserted_weight":1.0},
{"text":"The POL-NS-07 anti-farming check does not trip on this driver: driver_profile.no_show_terminations_30d is 1, below the threshold of 4, and 1 divided by driver_profile.completed_trips_30d (120) is 0.008, below 0.08. Driver compensation is not withheld on this ground and no POL-NS-09(d) escalation arises from this field.","evidence_ids":["EV-DPROF-09105"],"clause_ids":["POL-NS-07"],"asserted_weight":1.0},
{"text":"Profile fields are citable only for the test that names them: for POL-NS-07 only driver_profile.no_show_terminations_30d and driver_profile.completed_trips_30d, and for POL-NS-09(d) only rider_profile.no_show_disputes_30d. The driver's lifetime prior_no_show_flags (2), his rating (4.89) and the rider's lifetime prior_no_show_flags (1) are context only and may not be substituted for the trailing-window counters or used to build an adverse finding against the driver.","evidence_ids":["EV-DPROF-09105","EV-RPROF-09105"],"clause_ids":["POL-GEN-01"],"asserted_weight":1.0},
{"text":"No escalation limb under POL-NS-09 is met: rider_profile.disputes_with_counterparty_90d and driver_profile.disputes_with_counterparty_90d are both 0, so limb (c) fails; rider_profile.no_show_disputes_30d is 0, so limb (d) fails; and the artifacts do not conflict directly on arrival, dwell or rider presence — the trace is complete (34 fixes, 100% coverage, no gaps) and the chat log holds all 4 messages the trip record counts — so limbs (b) and (e) do not arise.","evidence_ids":["EV-RPROF-09105","EV-DPROF-09105","EV-GPS-09105","EV-CHAT-09105"],"clause_ids":["POL-NS-09"],"asserted_weight":1.0},
{"text":"Neither POL-NS-08 limb that bears on this record is engaged: the arrival marker at 13:05:20 is within 90 seconds of the trace, which begins at 13:05:00 on a 10-second sample with no gap, so there is no clock skew; and the SGD 4.00 cancellation fee equals the GREATER of the LARGE_VENUE zone-class fee (4.00) and the RYDE_X vehicle-tier fee (4.00), so there is no fare defect to correct and no basis for discounting the driver's record.","evidence_ids":["EV-FARE-09105","EV-GPS-09105","EV-TRIP-09105"],"clause_ids":["POL-NS-08"],"asserted_weight":1.0},
{"text":"The traffic advisory is MISSING and carries weight 0.0 with issue code MISSING_ARTIFACT — no advisory covers this pickup road or waiting window. POL-NS-06(i) accumulation is therefore unavailable to either side, and the absence of an advisory cannot be held against the driver, whose 330-second hold is proved by his own trace rather than by any enforcement or kerb-restriction excuse.","evidence_ids":["EV-ADVIS-09105-01"],"clause_ids":["POL-NS-06"],"asserted_weight":0.0}
]}

